sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Pipeline (subagent-dev)
    participant I as react-implementer
    participant SR as react-spec-reviewer
    participant CR as react-code-reviewer

    loop Each Task
        P->>I: Dispatch task + spec
        I->>I: Read files + knowledge base
        I->>I: Write test (TDD)
        I->>I: Implement code
        I->>I: Verify tests pass
        I->>I: Commit
        I-->>P: Report (files, tests, commit)

        P->>SR: Review spec compliance
        SR-->>P: PASS or FAIL (with gaps)

        alt FAIL
            P->>I: Return for fixes
            I-->>P: Fixed + new commit
        end

        P->>CR: Review code quality
        CR-->>P: PASS / COMMENT / CHANGE_REQUIRED

        alt CHANGE_REQUIRED
            P->>I: Return for fixes
            I-->>P: Fixed + new commit
        end
    end

    P->>P: All tasks complete
    Note over P: Trigger finish-branch
